### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### Valid prediction — firstClass
POST http://localhost:5000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Recife (PE)",
  "to": "Florianopolis (SC)",
  "flightType": "firstClass",
  "agency": "FlyingDrops",
  "date": "09/26/2026"
}

### Valid prediction — economic
POST http://localhost:5000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Recife (PE)",
  "to": "Florianopolis (SC)",
  "flightType": "economic",
  "agency": "CloudFy",
  "date": "09/26/2026"
}

### Invalid — missing fields
POST http://localhost:5000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Recife (PE)",
  "to": "Florianopolis (SC)"
}

### Invalid — unknown city
POST http://localhost:5000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Atlantis",
  "to": "Florianopolis (SC)",
  "flightType": "economic",
  "agency": "CloudFy",
  "date": "09/26/2026"
}

### Invalid — same from/to
POST http://localhost:5000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Recife (PE)",
  "to": "Recife (PE)",
  "flightType": "economic",
  "agency": "CloudFy",
  "date": "09/26/2026"
}

### Invalid — bad date format
POST http://localhost:5000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "Recife (PE)",
  "to": "Florianopolis (SC)",
  "flightType": "economic",
  "agency": "CloudFy",
  "date": "2026-09-26"
}
